// Base build settings.
// 1) Prefer: copy Secrets.xcconfig.example → Secrets.xcconfig and set the token there.
// 2) Or set VOXERA_API_TOKEN on the line AFTER the include (last assignment wins).
// 3) Debug without rebuild: Scheme → Run → Environment Variables → VOXERA_API_TOKEN.
// Do not put // inside the token value — xcconfig treats // as a comment.
VOXERA_API_TOKEN =
#include? "Secrets.xcconfig"
